mw_*
    - MetalWalls Au electrodes with NaCl-water electrolyte
    - Only 3 layers per electrode
mw_estat_super_symm
    - electrode/efield/thermo/nve actually does BEAEB splitting
    - estat and nve in one fix
    - results in log.csv numerically identical to mw_estat_symm
    - implementation is feat-fix-field-splitting branch
mw_estat_symm
    - electrode/efield/thermo with symm_split on
    - "BEEAB" splitting
mw_estat_semi_symm
    - symm_split off, but noise term is integrated in two steps
    - implementation is in src_ELECTRODE/
